ski for OS-9/68000==================ORIG holds comp.sources.games volume 11, Ski! 6.0, as posted.  ski.c,do_level.c and ski.h build unchanged: the recipe gives -Drandom=rand-Dsrandom=srand, since the default libraries have no random().  ski.hoffers the same through USE_RAND.DOC/ski holds the post's README and its formatted manual, ski.man.Measured: a run turns right and left at the ? prompt, and trees and bareground come up the slope behind the skier.Build: cc ski.c do_level.c -DOSK -Drandom=rand -Dsrandom=srand